### Authentication API Test File
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/users

### Variables
@token = 

### 1. Login with valid credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login with invalid password (should fail with 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 3. Login with non-existent user (should fail with 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistent",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Login with empty username (should fail with 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. Login with empty password (should fail with 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": ""
}

